body:
PUCL Delhi condemns assault on students and attack on book stall set up by students at the Cockroach Janta Party protest site, Jantar Mantar.

“The actions of the Delhi Police raise serious concerns regarding the freedoms guaranteed under Articles 19 and 21 of the Constitution. The use of such force against peaceful student protesters, the disruption of a book stall, the detention of students, the seizure of their mobile phones, and the intimidation through verbal abuse and threats are wholly inconsistent with the constitutional obligation of the police to facilitate, rather than suppress, peaceful democratic expression.”

@CJP_2029 @Cockroachisback @abhijeet_dipke @SauravDassss @AshutoshRanka

